### Issue

Aider is doing such a good job of generating code, but there's so much addition text that's generated unnecessarily.

The task below was completed successfully pretty early within the output. But then Aider had a bunch of times where "SEARCH/REPLACE block failed to match". I don't know if this is a linting issue or what, but it's a pain. Any advice here would be appreciated.

But probably more concerning is when Aider feels the need to play both sides in the conversation (scroll up from the bottom of the chat history to see this). Fortunately it didn't actually follow through with the suggestions it was making to itself (it was talking about making fundamental changes to my app), but it's unnerving.

